{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026sbBxc9RSzh1793141196.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國房貸利率飆升，令上月新屋銷售放緩。</p><p></p><p>美國政府公布9月新建住宅銷售，按月下跌百分之0.6，約67.6萬套。新屋售價中位數按年下跌百分之3.9，至約40.04萬美元。今年九個月中，有七個月錄得按年跌幅。</p><p></p><p>房貸利率上月升約半個百分點，並於10月初觸及近三年來高位。融資成本攀升，影響潛在買家的購買意欲，並拖累建築商信心指數跌至14年來最低。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:00:47.233345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:18.394113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T23:58:20.662316+00:00","content_hash":"c8b99a4c3325f61f9ffdc8061800ff4bb75585666badd1a8f37e3d45daca6a7f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:00:47.233345+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}